            "review_text": "thanhh0\nHo Chi Minh City, Vietnam2 contributions\n0\nGood food, nice design, great staff, what you asking for?\nNov 2016 • Friends\nI was there with my friends twice for lunch and dinner, the food was both times amazing very authentique Korean, the design is nice and upscale, the staff is very young and enthusiastic, one has recommend me the soya bean soup which I could never forget the taste, was so good! And you could not believe how cheap it is, I think if we dont rush, the price can be very much more because they have so much to offer\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nWritten November 24, 2016",
